<html lang="{{ shop.current_locale.code }}">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>This Shop is Closed</title>
    <meta name="description" content="">
    <meta name="author" content="">
    <style>
      * {
        font-family: "Source Sans Pro","Open Sans","Helvetica Neue", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
        -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        margin: 0;  
      }
      html, body {
        height: 100%;
        background-color: #f1f1f1;
      }
      .wrapper {
        min-height: 100%;
        height: auto !important;
        margin: 0 auto -235px; /* the bottom margin is the negative value of the footer's height */
        text-align: center;
        padding: 0px 30px;
      }
      .footer, .push {
        height: 235px; /* .push must be the same height as .footer */
      }
      .title {
        font-size: 600%;
        font-weight: 900;
        color:rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        line-height: 100px;
        margin-bottom: 15px;
        padding-top: 80px;
        letter-spacing: -1px;
      }   
      .engtext {
        font-size: 140%;
        font-weight: 800;
        color:rgba(0,0,0,0.7);
        line-height: 50px;
      }
      .chitext {
        font-size: 140%;
        font-weight: 800;
        color:rgba(0,0,0,0.7);
        line-height: 30px;
        margin-bottom: 30px;
      }
      @media (max-width: 767px) {
        .title {
          margin-top: 20px;
        }
        .footer, .push {
          height: 130px; /* .push must be the same height as .footer */
        }
        .wrapper {
          margin: 0 auto -130px; /* the bottom margin is the negative value of the footer's height */
        }
        .engtext {
          line-height: 30px;
          margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .chitext {
          margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="wrapper">
      <div class="title">SHOP CLOSED</div>
      <div class="engtext">Sorry, the shop you are looking for is closed right now, please try again later.</div>
      <div class="chitext">謝謝光臨！對不起我們現在休息中，很快重開。</div>
      <div class="push"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="footer"></div>
  </body>
</html>